{"title":"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 Part B","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2021 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438804765b8e1a0f3ba6b64ccac6975826a4568e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98^{2} - 4 = 100k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/9/6b940b0fd35402db15a9dcb9f715d7da1b75efce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k = 98^{2} - 4 = 9604 - 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"212\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/d/edd9e556863d0f9b74a1741f455509626a3c4a20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100k = 9600$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/5/a355c71c88e17e9be602fd07a67d09122a4636e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = \\frac{9600}{100} = \\boxed{96}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1_Part_B&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the answer from part a, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/8/438804765b8e1a0f3ba6b64ccac6975826a4568e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$98^{2} - 4 = 100k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/7/ec78a85072d0bff89eedff1c8f8ab76f296943fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(98 + 2)(98 - 2) = 100k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"191\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/3/df3971cd9dd81a9365b8b24a0e76a92511cc48ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 \\times 96 = 100k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>From this, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc1e8df316e5850817fea216b7f5f5aa29c8e6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{k = 96}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"66\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063600\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.017 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 50/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1702/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.626      1 2021_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\n100.00%    7.626      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37413:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018063600 and revision id 289135. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}